@baseUrl = http://localhost:3010
@apiVersion = v1
@accessToken =

### Safety snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/safety
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Pulse deadman
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/safety/deadman/pulse
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Release deadman
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/safety/deadman/release
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
